  "npcs": [
    {
      "id": "dg2_umbercap",
      "name": "King Umbercap",
      "title": "of the Moss Court",
      "shortName": "Umbercap",
      "sprite": "cr_mossling_shaman",
      "portrait": "cr_mossling_shaman",
      "dialogue": "dlg_dg2_umbercap",
      "bark": "Small again! Small and DAMP. Marvellous."
    }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "dlg_dg2_mossking",
      "start": "mk_1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "mk_1",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "*The cavern opens into a hall of glowing moss. On a throne of tangled roots sits a mossling the size of a haystack, crowned with mushrooms. In the middle of his crown, where a jewel should be, a grey ember pulses like a slow, sick heartbeat. His eyes open — bright, and not entirely his own.*",
          "next": "mk_2"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_2",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "WHO COMES TO THE MOSS COURT? *The voice is huge and damp and very tired.* The glow is MINE to keep. Keep it. Keep it. Keep it all. *The grey ember throbs, and every light in the hall dims.*",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Your Majesty, the glow is choking the old wood above.",
              "check": {"skill": "Persuasion", "dc": 15, "success": "mk_pers_s", "failure": "mk_pers_f"},
              "tag": "PERSUASION"
            },
            {
              "text": "(Speak in the slow, damp language of moss and stone.)",
              "next": "mk_shaman",
              "conditions": [{"type": "Class", "key": "Shaman"}],
              "tag": "SHAMAN"
            },
            {
              "text": "That ember in your crown isn't moss. It's ash.",
              "check": {"skill": "Nature", "dc": 13, "success": "mk_nat_s", "failure": "mk_nat_f"},
              "tag": "NATURE"
            },
            {"text": "Sprig sent us. He sang us your song.", "next": "mk_sprig", "conditions": [{"type": "QuestActive", "key": "ww2_kings_glow"}]},
            {"text": "(Attack.)", "next": "mk_fight"}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_pers_s",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "*For a moment the huge eyes clear.* Choking...? I only meant to keep it SAFE. The grey star fell into the glade and I carried it down here so it could hurt no one, and then it... it... *The ember flares, and his voice drowns under it.* KEEP IT. KEEP IT ALL.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_king_soothed"}],
          "next": "mk_fight2"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_pers_f",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "CHOKING? NOTHING IS CHOKING. EVERYTHING IS KEPT. *He rises, and the hall shakes.*",
          "next": "mk_fight"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_shaman",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "*You speak the slow tongue of moss. Deep inside the giant, something small and green answers — one word, 'help' — before the grey ember drowns it out.*",
          "outcomes": [
            {"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_king_soothed"},
            {"type": "Approval", "key": "nanami", "amount": 3},
            {"type": "Approval", "key": "torvan", "amount": 3}
          ],
          "next": "mk_fight2"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_nat_s",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "*You see it now: the ember is a seed of grey ash, sunk into his crown like a splinter, feeding on the glow and on him. Break the crown's glow, and the seed will break with it.*",
          "outcomes": [
            {"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_seed_spotted"},
            {"type": "Approval", "key": "lys", "amount": 3},
            {"type": "Approval", "key": "morwen", "amount": 2}
          ],
          "next": "mk_fight2"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_nat_f",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "MOSS. IT IS ALL MOSS. EVERYTHING IS MOSS. *That does not seem entirely right, but he is very large.*",
          "next": "mk_fight"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_sprig",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "*The giant blinks, slow as a sunrise.* Sprig...? Small Sprig? He used to bring me soup... *The ember flares.* NO. NO VISITORS. THE GLOW IS KEPT.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_king_soothed"}],
          "next": "mk_fight2"
        },
        {
          "id": "mk_fight2",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "*The grey ember blazes, and the giant lurches up from his throne. Whatever is left of the King inside, the seed is not letting go without a fight.*",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "StartCombat", "key": "enc_dg2_mossking"}]
        },
        {"id": "mk_fight", "speaker": "dg2_umbercap", "text": "THE GLOW IS KEPT!", "outcomes": [{"type": "StartCombat", "key": "enc_dg2_mossking"}]}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_dg2_umbercap",
      "start": "uc_done",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "uc_done",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "Off you go, big-folk. Umbercap has a hundred years of naps to catch up on, and he intends to start immediately.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}],
          "fallback": "uc_1",
          "choices": [{"text": "Goodbye."}]
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_1",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "*Where the giant fell sits a mossling no bigger than a cabbage, wearing a crown of tiny mushrooms that is now much too large for him. Beside him lies a cracked grey ember, cold at last.*",
          "next": "uc_2s"
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_2s",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "You talked to me. Down there, under all that grey, I heard you. Thank you for that... and for the hitting, I suppose. It needed doing.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_king_soothed"}],
          "fallback": "uc_2",
          "choices": [
            {"text": "What was that grey ember?", "next": "uc_seed", "once": true},
            {"text": "Sprig is waiting for you up top.", "next": "uc_sprig", "once": true},
            {"text": "Go home safe, Your Majesty.", "next": "uc_gift", "conditions": [{"type": "NotFlag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]},
            {"text": "Goodbye.", "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_2",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "Ow. Ow. Everything is ow. ...But it is MY ow again. Thank you, big-folk.",
          "choices": [
            {"text": "What was that grey ember?", "next": "uc_seed", "once": true},
            {"text": "Sprig is waiting for you up top.", "next": "uc_sprig", "once": true},
            {"text": "Go home safe, Your Majesty.", "next": "uc_gift", "conditions": [{"type": "NotFlag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]},
            {"text": "Goodbye.", "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_more",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "*He adjusts his enormous crown. It slides over one eye.*",
          "choices": [
            {"text": "What was that grey ember?", "next": "uc_seed", "once": true},
            {"text": "Sprig is waiting for you up top.", "next": "uc_sprig", "once": true},
            {"text": "Go home safe, Your Majesty.", "next": "uc_gift", "conditions": [{"type": "NotFlag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]},
            {"text": "Goodbye.", "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"}]}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_seed",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "It fell out of the sky, long ago — or not so long; I lose count down here. A grey star on a warm wind from the north, smelling of a fire very far away. Where it landed, the glow went sick. I carried it down here so it couldn't hurt the forest. Then it started carrying me. *He shivers.* Somewhere up north, something is still burning. Something big.",
          "outcomes": [{"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_heard_of_ash"}],
          "next": "uc_more"
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_sprig",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "Sprig? Small Sprig! Puddlecap's sister's boy! He used to bring me soup, down to the first step, every week, and shout 'SOUP, YOUR MAJESTY' into the dark. *His eyes shine.* I'll go up. I'll go up and tell him it was very good soup.",
          "next": "uc_more"
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_gift",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "Wait, wait! Royalty does not let its rescuers leave empty-handed. Take the ember, so it is far from my moss — and show it to somebody wise. And... *he rummages in his cape of leaves*... this.",
          "conditions": [{"type": "Flag", "key": "dg2_king_soothed"}],
          "fallback": "uc_gift_plain",
          "outcomes": [
            {"type": "GiveItem", "key": "dg2_ashen_seed", "amount": 1},
            {"type": "GiveItem", "key": "dg2_glowcap_lantern", "amount": 1},
            {"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"},
            {"type": "GiveXP", "amount": 75}
          ],
          "choices": [{"text": "(Continue.)"}]
        },
        {
          "id": "uc_gift_plain",
          "speaker": "dg2_umbercap",
          "text": "Wait! Take the ember, so it is far from my moss — and show it to somebody wise. Somebody who knows about fires in the north.",
          "outcomes": [
            {"type": "GiveItem", "key": "dg2_ashen_seed", "amount": 1},
            {"type": "SetFlag", "key": "dg2_umbercap_thanked"},
            {"type": "GiveXP", "amount": 75}
          ],
          "choices": [{"text": "(Continue.)"}]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
